# The exported symbols of the shared engine library, one per line (Phase 23 Day 344). `tools/abi_check` compares this list with the built library's dynamic
# symbol table and, through git, with the last commit's list: adding a symbol needs a bump of the minor version below, removing one a bump of the major
# version; `include/engine/engine_abi_version.h` must carry the same numbers. The linker's version script is generated from this file (the node is named
# ENGINE_<major>).
#
# The one export is the entry point of the C API (Day 346); everything else the host reaches is a function of the table it returns. Until the first release
# the list is `status unreleased`: the version-bump rule is not enforced (nothing is installed anywhere); the first release (Day 357) removes that line.
version 1.0
status unreleased
engine_get_api
